      "id": "claim_5f02a3ce78a04332af86e9ee7c9385d1",
      "statement": "QuickJS is a normal dcode dependency used as in-process JavaScript REPL middleware rather than a registered remote sandbox provider; `CodeInterpreterMiddleware` isolates interpreter slots by LangGraph thread and exposes an `eval` tool without filesystem, network, or real-clock access.",
